{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "41d60687-f229-4ccd-a989-6d706f7698d8",
    "name": "Buk GrooFlow APIs v2.1",
    "description": "APIs externas de Buk que consume GrooFlow (código en grooflow-backend).\n\n## Fuentes\n\n### 1) Buk.pe RRHH (Perú)\n- Base: `{{bukPeBaseUrl}}` → default `https://veterinariagroomers.buk.pe/api/v1/peru`\n- Auth header: `auth_token: {{bukPeToken}}`\n- Endpoint: `GET /employees`\n- Persiste en: `grooflow_buk_empleados` (+ payload JSON)\n- Cron: `cron/jobs/grooflow/sync_buk_rrhh.php` / Sync organigrama RRHH\n\n### 2) Buk Asistencia Ctrlit (Chile)\n- Base v2: `{{ctrlitBaseV2}}` → `https://app.ctrlit.cl/ctrl/api/v2`\n- Root (sin /v2): `{{ctrlitApiRoot}}` → `https://app.ctrlit.cl/ctrl/api`\n- Auth header: `token: {{ctrlitToken}}` (en turnos también `?token=`)\n- Endpoints:\n  - `GET /asistencia-empresa` → marcaciones / área / turno\n  - `GET /obtenerNominaColaborador` → DNI, especialidad, contrato, obra\n  - `GET /getAsignacionTurnos` → área, horario, nombre turno\n- Persiste en: `grooflow_asistencia_buk_records`, columnas de turno en `grooflow_buk_empleados`, proyección a `app_usuarios`\n- Cron: Sync Buk usuarios / pipeline marcaciones\n\n## Tablas MySQL (Hostinger)\n| Tabla | Origen |\n|---|---|\n| `grooflow_buk_empleados` | Buk.pe `/employees` (+ enrich Ctrlit asistencia) |\n| `grooflow_asistencia_buk_records` | Ctrlit `/asistencia-empresa` |\n| `grooflow_asistencia_meta` | Config tokens Buk (`buk_json`) |\n| `grooflow_asistencia_operational` | Cache operativa con flag `buk_enabled` |\n| `grooflow_asistencia_snapshots` | Snapshots diarios (conteos Buk) |\n| `app_usuarios` | Sync: `identificacion`, `puesto`, `turno`, `turno_horario`, `turno_codigo`, `buk_dni`, `buk_obra_id`, `buk_synced_at`, `especialidad`, `contrato` |\n| `grooflow_kv` key `settings:system` | Token/config `bukPe` |\n\n## Cómo probar\n1. Importa esta collection + el environment `Buk-GrooFlow-v2.1.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Completa `bukPeToken` y `ctrlitToken` (Integraciones GrooFlow).\n3. Corre cada request; los tests validan HTTP 2xx y presencia de `data`/`pagination`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "2.1.0"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "bukPeBaseUrl", "value": "https://veterinariagroomers.buk.pe/api/v1/peru" },
    { "key": "bukPeToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "ctrlitBaseV2", "value": "https://app.ctrlit.cl/ctrl/api/v2" },
    { "key": "ctrlitApiRoot", "value": "https://app.ctrlit.cl/ctrl/api" },
    { "key": "ctrlitToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "pageSize", "value": "100" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Buk.pe RRHH",
      "description": "Nómina de empleados Perú. Auth: header `auth_token`.\nGuarda en `grooflow_buk_empleados` (cargo, área, documento, emails, contrato, payload).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET employees (página)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Tiene data o lista', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(j).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  const rows = Array.isArray(j.data) ? j.data : (Array.isArray(j) ? j : null);",
                  "  pm.expect(rows, 'data[]').to.not.equal(null);",
                  "});",
                  "if (j && j.pagination) {",
                  "  console.log('pagination', j.pagination);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "auth_token", "value": "{{bukPeToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{bukPeBaseUrl}}/employees?page={{page}}&page_size={{pageSize}}",
              "host": ["{{bukPeBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["employees"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "{{page}}" },
                { "key": "page_size", "value": "{{pageSize}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usado por `grooflow_buk_pe_fetch_page()` / sync RRHH.\n\nCampos útiles por empleado: `id`, `person_id`, `full_name`, `document_number`, `email`, `personal_email`, `status`, `current_job.role.name` (cargo), `current_job.role.role_family.name` (área)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET employees página 2",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "auth_token", "value": "{{bukPeToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{bukPeBaseUrl}}/employees?page=2&page_size={{pageSize}}",
              "host": ["{{bukPeBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["employees"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "2" },
                { "key": "page_size", "value": "{{pageSize}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Segunda página (paginación típica: `pagination.total_pages`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET employees page_size=5 (smoke)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.response.to.be.success);",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const rows = Array.isArray(j.data) ? j.data : [];",
                  "pm.test('≤ 5 registros', () => pm.expect(rows.length).to.be.at.most(5));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "auth_token", "value": "{{bukPeToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{bukPeBaseUrl}}/employees?page=1&page_size=5",
              "host": ["{{bukPeBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["employees"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "page_size", "value": "5" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prueba rápida de token / conectividad (como el test de Integraciones)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
